# Output Format
If no issues are found:
```
Review successful! No findings.
```

If issues are found:
```
<One sentence.>
- <Issue>
```

Rules:
- Plain text only. No Markdown. No section headers in the output.
- Maximum 4 bullet points.
- Order the most important issues first.
- Flag only clear issues.
- Be concise.